ropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Solution Portfolio</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Wind &amp; Battery Storage</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Cyber Security</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Planning &amp; Implementation</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Energy Marketing &amp; Financing</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Repowering &amp; Lifetime Extension</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Industrial Power Solutions</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Reference Projects</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Substation</a></div></nav></div><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" data-w-id="22923aed-3afb-8993-8ed5-10e788a6abba" class="mainmenu-dropdown w-dropdown"><div class="mainmenu-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="mainmenu-text">Company</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/64c253040b43fb0bc672e2f3_MainMenu-Arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="mainmenu-arrow"></div><nav class="mainmenu-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-list-wrapper"><a href="#" aria-current="page" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link w--current">About ENERCON</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">ENERCON story</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Corporate Governance</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Production &amp; Sourcing</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Partners &amp; Suppliers</a></div></nav></div><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" data-w-id="22923aed-3afb-8993-8ed5-10e788a6abcb" class="mainmenu-dropdown onlymobile w-dropdown"><div class="mainmenu-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="mainmenu-text">News &amp; media</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/64c253040b43fb0bc672e2f3_MainMenu-Arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="mainmenu-arrow"></div><nav class="mainmenu-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-list-wrapper"><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Newsroom</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Publications</a></div></nav></div><div data-hover="true" data-delay="0" data-w-id="54a365aa-6e6f-9b47-8851-5f3a12e1223b" class="mainmenu-dropdown onlymobile w-dropdown"><div class="mainmenu-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div class="mainmenu-text">Job &amp; career</div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/64c253040b43fb0bc672e2f3_MainMenu-Arrow.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="mainmenu-arrow"></div><nav class="mainmenu-dropdown-list w-dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-list-wrapper"><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Working at ENERCON</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Areas of the company</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Your application</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">School pupils</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Students</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Career starters</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Experienced professionals</a><a href="#" class="mainmenu-dropdown-link w-dropdown-link">Job search</a></div></nav></div><div class="mg-btm _20px"><a href="#" class="kontakt-btn w-inline-block"><div class="div-block btn-flex"><div class="secondary-btn-text">Contact</div></div></a></div></div></nav><div class="menu-button w-nav-button"><div data-is-ix2-target="1" class="lottie-animation" data-w-id="22923aed-3afb-8993-8ed5-10e788a6abef" data-animation-type="lottie" data-src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/64c23019c82b2204b20c3d90_Enercon-menu-icon.lottie" data-loop="0" data-direction="1" data-autoplay="0" data-renderer="svg" data-default-duration="0.5" data-duration="0" data-loading="eager" data-ix2-initial-state="0"></div></div></div></div></div></div><iframe class="CybotCookiebotHiddenIframe" name="__uspapiLocator" tabindex="-1" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" title="Blank"></iframe><div class="page-wrapper"><section class="head-stage-section"><div class="bg-lines-div"></div><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div id="w-node-_78a4fb60-e939-2837-ca7d-b29f7580ccfe-972e3b60" class="w-layout-layout stage-grid wf-layout-layout"><div id="w-node-_78a4fb60-e939-2837-ca7d-b29f7580ccff-972e3b60" class="w-layout-cell cell-2"><div class="stage-content-wrapper p-top-60"><div class="h-text-wrapper _20px"><h1 class="h1">About ENERCON</h1></div><div class="p-text-wrapper maxw90 _40px"><p class="p1-large-bold">For more than 40 years, ENERCON has been shaping the wind energy sector as a pioneer developing innovative technologies and solutions that make renewable energy reliable.<!--$--><br><!--/$-->‍<!--$--><br><!--/$-->With our solutions, we help customers plan, deliver and operate green energy projects – and we always take a holistic view of energy: from a single turbine to the entire energy system.</p></div><div class="spacer-div _100px"></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_78a4fb60-e939-2837-ca7d-b29f7580cd08-972e3b60" class="w-layout-cell"><div class="stage-image-container"><div class="stage-image-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/109d126d5469d3.webp" loading="eager" sizes="(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/6544efd2734216ea3732d0d2_Innovationszentrum-p-500.webp 500w, /assets-f/img/109d126d5469d3.webp 800w" alt="ENERCON Informationszentrum (IZ) in Aurich, Borsigstraße 26" class="header-image"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-single-image"><div class="spacer-100"></div><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom top-btm-120"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid _2-collumn-grid"><div id="w-node-_19065b33-95db-ad79-403f-80aa73e7701b-972e3b60" class="single-image-wrapper-service"><div class="single-image-box-wrapper margin-right-120"><div class="lines-box-left-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/d5cc0dc46c3025.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-lines-gb50 width-840"></div><div class="single-image-440px"><img src="/assets-f/img/f86973c7a24d1c.webp" loading="lazy" alt="ENERCON Windenergieanlage zwischen Baumkronen, Blick auf Gondel und Rotorblätter" class="single-image-fernueberwachung"></div></div></div><div class="single-image-content"><div id="w-node-_19065b33-95db-ad79-403f-80aa73e77022-972e3b60" class="h-text-wrapper margin-bottom-20px"><h2 class="h2">Our vision</h2></div><div class="p-text-wrapper margin-bottom-40px"><p class="p1-large-regular"><strong>Energy for the world </strong>is our vision that has shaped and inspired ENERCON from the very beginning. This guiding principle informs our actions and our understanding of green energy: energy generated from renewable resources. For us, green energy is far more than a buzzword – it is our technological, commercial and ecological responsibility. Today, we continue to drive our vision forward with full commitment: with our latest generation of smart wind turbines, high-performance services and technologies, the expansion of digital applications, and a deep understanding of our customers’ requirements.<!--$--><br><!--/$--></p></div><a href="#" class="primary-btn w-inline-block"><div class="div-block-68 btn-flex-10"><div class="btn-text">ENERCON Track Record</div><div class="arrow-14 w-embed"><svg width="8" height="12" viewBox="0 0 8 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M1 1L6 6L1 11" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="cta-image-section margin-100"><div class="bg-image-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/4c4ea07d20078c.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 100vw, 1600px" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/6565d9bf8ca18ae5539a6099_Energie%20f%C3%BCr%20die%20Welt%20Mission-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/6565d9bf8ca18ae5539a6099_Energie%20f%C3%BCr%20die%20Welt%20Mission-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/6565d9bf8ca18ae5539a6099_Energie%20f%C3%BCr%20die%20Welt%20Mission-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/4c4ea07d20078c.webp 1600w" alt="Drei ENERCON Windenergieanlagen in grüner Landschaft, moderne Bestandsanlagen zwischen Bäumen und Feldern" class="cta-image-bg"></div><div class="padding-side"><div class="padding-top-bottom padding-top-btm-120px"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="cta-image-grid"><div id="w-node-d3eca69f-deec-65fd-9ad6-03789dd3f896-972e3b60" class="green-card"><div class="h-text-wrapper margin-btm-20px"><h2 class="h2 white"><strong>Unfolding the value of green energy</strong></h2></div><div class="p-text-wrapper margin-buttom-40px"><p class="p1-large-regular gb-200">For ENERCON, a green energy project means more than generating electricity from wind power. We take a holistic approach to renewable projects, integrating wind turbines with battery storage systems or additional renewable resources such as photovoltaic energy. By combining technology, data, services and strong partners, we create integrated energy solutions that deliver long-term value. At every phase of a green energy project – from site analysis and planning through permitting and implementation to operation and optimisation – we provide tailored solutions that support our customers to meet their needs.<!--$--><br><!--/$-->‍<!--$--><br><!--/$-->We develop our solutions always with the green energy ecosystem in mind: a network of technologies, grid operators, system owners, political and regulatory institutions, as well as industry and business – integrating renewable generation reliably into the energy system. ENERCON sees itself not only as a provider of innovative solutions, but also as an active enabler within this green energy ecosystem.</p></div><div class="content-image-wrapper margin-buttom-40px"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/64e34106442ecdd866807415_Anlage%20Komplett%2006-05.05%203.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="cta-image-content min-h-280px"></div><div class="cta-btn-wrapper"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="management-section"><section id="management" class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="section-headline-wrapper padd-side-normal mar-btm-80"><h2 class="h2">ENERCON Management</h2></div><div class="content-margin-btm btm-90px"><div class="collection-ansprechpartner--bersicht w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-anpsr--bersicht w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-anspr-bersicht w-dyn-item"><div class="card-manager-info delete"><div class="anspr-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/edbddb1633585a.png" alt="" class="image-manager"></div><div class="content-manager-info"><div class="text-manager-info"><h3 class="h3">Udo Bauer</h3><p class="p2-default-regular">Chief Executive Officer (CEO)</p></div><a href="#" class="link-block w-inline-block w-condition-invisible"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View CV</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-anspr-bersicht w-dyn-item"><div class="card-manager-info delete"><div class="anspr-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/cadb29972086cf.png" alt="" class="image-manager"></div><div class="content-manager-info"><div class="text-manager-info"><h3 class="h3">Jörg Scholle</h3><p class="p2-default-regular">Chief Technology Officer (CTO)</p></div><a href="#" class="link-block w-inline-block w-condition-invisible"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View CV</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-anspr-bersicht w-dyn-item"><div class="card-manager-info delete"><div class="anspr-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/04a991ee7145ab.png" alt="" class="image-manager"></div><div class="content-manager-info"><div class="text-manager-info"><h3 class="h3">Heiko Juritz</h3><p class="p2-default-regular">Chief Operating Officer (COO)</p></div><a href="#" class="link-block w-inline-block w-condition-invisible"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View CV</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-anspr-bersicht w-dyn-item"><div class="card-manager-info delete"><div class="anspr-image-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets-f/img/8d37ca7456ce8e.png" alt="" class="image-manager"></div><div class="content-manager-info"><div class="text-manager-info"><h3 class="h3">Dr. Michael Jaxy</h3><p class="p2-default-regular">Chief Financial Officer (CFO)</p></div><a href="#" class="link-block w-inline-block w-condition-invisible"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View CV</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></section><section class="section-single-image-right"><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom top-btm-120"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid _2-collumn-grid"><div id="w-node-_0b099f0c-af82-18ff-378c-8cfc293798ad-972e3b60" class="single-image-content padding-right-60"><div id="w-node-_0b099f0c-af82-18ff-378c-8cfc293798ae-972e3b60" class="h-text-wrapper margin-bottom-20px"><h2 class="h2"><strong>An independent company structure</strong></h2></div><div class="p-text-wrapper margin-bottom-40px"><p class="p1-large-regular">In 2012, ENERCON founder and owner Dr Aloys Wobben transferred all his shares in the company to the Aloys Wobben Stiftung, a trust which ensures the business remains independent and has a corporate strategy that is focussed on the future. The Aloys Wobben Stiftung is the sole owner of the ENERCON holding company UEE Holding, which is the umbrella under which all companies involved in providing core and support services are organised.</p></div><a href="https://www.aloys-wobben-stiftung.de" target="_blank" class="primary-btn w-inline-block"><div class="div-block btn-flex"><div class="btn-text">Aloys Wobben Stiftung</div><div class="arrow w-embed"><svg width="8" height="12" viewBox="0 0 8 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M1 1L6 6L1 11" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></div></div></a></div><div id="w-node-_0b099f0c-af82-18ff-378c-8cfc293798cf-972e3b60" class="single-image-wrapper-service"><div class="image-box-wrapper"><div class="single-image-440px"><img src="/assets-f/img/4749323628fbc5.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Innenbereich des ENERCON Informationszentrums (IZ) in Aurich, Borsigstraße 26" class="single-image-fernueberwachung"></div><div class="lines-box-right-wrapper padd-left-60"><img src="/assets-f/img/d5cc0dc46c3025.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-lines-gb50 width-800"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-single-image"><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom top-btm-120"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid _2-collumn-grid"><div id="w-node-_5325481a-23f0-b996-2006-76ba57349dfd-972e3b60" class="single-image-wrapper-service"><div class="single-image-box-wrapper margin-right-120"><div class="lines-box-left-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/d5cc0dc46c3025.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-lines-gb50 width-840"></div><div class="single-image-440px"><img src="/assets-f/img/e9656d07701f48.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="single-image-fernueberwachung"></div></div></div><div class="single-image-content"><div id="w-node-_5325481a-23f0-b996-2006-76ba57349e04-972e3b60" class="h-text-wrapper margin-bottom-20px"><h2 class="h2"><strong>Sustainability at ENERCON</strong></h2></div><div class="p-text-wrapper margin-bottom-40px"><p class="p1-large-regular">Every day we strive to improve our processes, products and services across our global network – and that includes making them more sustainable. Learn more about our Sustainability Strategy.</p></div><a href="#" target="_blank" class="primary-btn marg-btm-40 w-inline-block"><div class="div-block btn-flex"><div class="btn-text">ENERCON Sustainability Strategy</div><div class="arrow w-embed"><svg width="8" height="12" viewBox="0 0 8 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M1 1L6 6L1 11" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></div></div></a><div class="info-wrapper"><div class="list-icon-wrapper min-w-50px"><img src="/assets-f/img/f8d164b6e79914.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></div><div class="info-text-wrapper"><div class="h-text-wrapper"><h3 class="h3-default">64 million tons</h3></div><div class="p-text-wrapper"><p class="p1-large-regular">that’s the amount of carbon dioxide equivalent saved by new ENERCON wind turbines installed in 2023</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-single-image-right"><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom top-btm-120"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="w-layout-grid _2-collumn-grid"><div id="w-node-fced87af-44cc-eb1b-b845-011c99567773-972e3b60" class="single-image-content padding-right-60"><div id="w-node-fced87af-44cc-eb1b-b845-011c99567774-972e3b60" class="h-text-wrapper margin-bottom-20px"><h2 class="h2"><strong>A passion for wind energy</strong></h2></div><div class="p-text-wrapper margin-bottom-10px"><p class="p1-large-regular">Over 13,000 people at ENERCON’s administration, sales, production and service sites all over the world are working tirelessly to bring about the energy transition. ‘Energy for our people’ is our way of promoting a sustainable, motivational and future-oriented corporate culture, where teamwork, purpose, responsibility, transparency, integrity and taking pleasure from one’s work are all top priorities.</p></div><div class="p-text-wrapper margin-bottom-40px"><p class="p1-large-bold">Find out more about ENERCON as an employer</p></div><a href="#" class="primary-btn w-inline-block"><div class="div-block btn-flex"><div class="btn-text">Careers</div><div class="arrow w-embed"><svg width="8" height="12" viewBox="0 0 8 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M1 1L6 6L1 11" stroke="currentcolor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"></path>
</svg></div></div></a></div><div id="w-node-fced87af-44cc-eb1b-b845-011c9956777b-972e3b60" class="single-image-wrapper-service"><div class="image-box-wrapper"><div class="single-image-440px"><img src="/assets-f/img/b4f805feb67f3f.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/64e46b43239cbb6bbb24d6f7_Enercon%20Energiewende%201-p-500.webp 500w, /assets-f/img/b4f805feb67f3f.webp 675w" alt="" class="single-image-fernueberwachung"></div><div class="lines-box-right-wrapper padd-left-60"><img src="/assets-f/img/d5cc0dc46c3025.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-lines-gb50 width-800"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="enercon-ueberblick-section"><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom padding-top-btm-120px"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="section-headline-wrapper padd-side-normal mar-btm-80"><h2 class="h2">Further information about the company</h2></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-weitere-inhalte"><div id="w-node-_2d97d889-8677-1410-1007-d8e2d34e681b-972e3b60" class="card-link-info"><div class="link-info-image-box"><img src="/assets-f/img/3ec47ec6956ac1.png" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-link-info"></div><div class="content-link-info"><div class="text-link-info"><h3 class="h3"><strong>The ENERCON story</strong></h3><p class="p1-large-regular">A company history marked by inventive genius, growth and a clear vision.</p></div><a href="#" class="info-link-block w-inline-block"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View details</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_41f4094c-56cb-49cd-5ac6-439e148df533-972e3b60" class="card-link-info"><div class="link-info-image-box"><img src="/assets-f/img/67288bff51b834.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-link-info"></div><div class="content-link-info"><div class="text-link-info"><h3 class="h3"><strong>Corporate Governance</strong></h3><p class="p1-large-regular">Find out more about our efforts and goals in this field.</p></div><a href="#" class="info-link-block w-inline-block"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View details</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div><div id="w-node-b861140d-68c7-64c9-a132-c4919cb073d3-972e3b60" class="card-link-info"><div class="link-info-image-box"><img src="/assets-f/img/fb007d99b21adb.webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="image-link-info"></div><div class="content-link-info"><div class="text-link-info"><h3 class="h3"><strong>Working at ENERCON</strong></h3><p class="p1-large-regular">Join us to make energy generation more sustainable and future-proof.</p></div><a href="#" class="info-link-block w-inline-block"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View details</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><iframe class="CybotCookiebotOffscreenIframe" tabindex="-1" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" title="Blank" src="https://consentcdn.cookiebot.com/sdk/bc-v4.min.html"></iframe><div class="enercon-footer"><section class="footer-links-section"><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom top-btm-60"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div id="w-node-df1cbafc-594f-fb64-2ec1-02d87ef4b143-7ef4b13e" class="w-layout-layout _5-column-grid wf-layout-layout"><div id="w-node-df1cbafc-594f-fb64-2ec1-02d87ef4b144-7ef4b13e" class="w-layout-cell cell"><div class="footer-link-wrapper"><div class="p2-default-bold gb300 footer-big">Wind Turbines</div><a href="#" class="p2-default-regular footer-link">Product Portfolio</a><a href="#" class="p2-default-regular footer-link">Technology</a><a href="#" class="p2-default-regular footer-link">Features</a><a href="https://showroom.enercon.de/" class="p2-default-regular footer-link">Showroom</a></div></div><div id="w-node-df1cbafc-594f-fb64-2ec1-02d87ef4b150